#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""utils/Env/run — the runner's entry point (docs/06_Internals.md §2).

`hep run …` and `hep watch …` land here. Everything else is in the `runner` package beside this
file, and in the tool folders `utils/Env/<tool>/`.
"""

